1ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Do you mean Pizzario's? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Yes, their pizza is really good. They also make great panini!", "id": 2, "time": "8500", "image": "engenn3le01ob04re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: I hear the owners are from Rome, Italy.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: That's cool. I know you would really like it. It's the most  popular pizza place in town.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Is anyone else going?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Just us. Vanessa is going to the movies and Peter is studying.", "id": 3, "time": "15500", "image": "engenn3le01ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Ahhh ... Actually, I'm not feeling very well.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: What's wrong?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: I have a headache ... sorry. Can we all go out another time?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Can I get you something for it?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: No, it's OK.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Alright, maybe another night. I'll phone you on the weekend. Can I have a rain check?", "id": 4, "time": "30500", "image": "engenn3le01ob04re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn3le01ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le01ob04re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}